          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Our Insides Red</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora just can't leave things alone, and purposefully allows herself to get captured to just see her enemy up close. Catra has changed so much, having brought the very Horde to their knees. She does the same to Adora.&lt;br /&gt;Will things ever work out between them as Adora is taken prisoner, and Catra's heat is beginning to make itself known, or will they fall back to being at each other's throats?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Crypfic</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer and Lonnie show up briefly</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Lord Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Dom Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sub Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alpha/Beta/Omega Dynamics</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alpha Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Omega Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>angsty</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Smut</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Needs a Hug (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs a Hug (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Instead these two are just going to fuck each other</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>red red red</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>somewhat bittersweet ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>"Reads like a gothic romance" - my friend</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oneshot</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Is this what Twitter calls toxic yuri?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
